<title>POLAND: KROSNO SWINGS TO LOSS IN SEPTEMBER.</title>
<headline>KROSNO SWINGS TO LOSS IN SEPTEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.10 vs   0.57 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.14 vs   1.45 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.07 vs   1.55</p>
<p> Sales		   15.05 vs  14.27</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.16 vs   6.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.54 vs  10.88</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.42 vs  13.09</p>
<p> Sales		  134.79 vs 111.54</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is Krosnienskie Huty</p>
<p>Szkla Krosno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
